{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Butcher's Village</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game that provides a deeply immersive and horrifying experience. Explore unsettling environments, solve intricate puzzles, and struggle to survive in a village that is at once eerily familiar and terrifyingly real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>IMPORTANT NOTE: The game focuses on exploration and builds tension slowly to create a deeper and more meaningful experience. Its story is unveiled through surreal imagery and subtle environmental details. It also includes intricate puzzles, and be mindful that it is a difficult game in unconventional ways.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.poster.avif?t=1769255120\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.webm?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/8e98badc1e73ea026e1cf5ab0f97fe27.mp4?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/1c246e571ed13b65b8ac049e1ffebda2.avif?t=1769255120\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murtaza, living in North America in 2001, receives a desperate call from his friend asking for help one rainy evening. He drives through heavy rain, but because of the dense fog, he gets into an accident. When he regains consciousness, his vehicle is wrecked and won\u2019t start. As he looks around, he notices an eerie village nearby, shrouded in the storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights, rapid visual effects, and intense imagery that may trigger seizures or other adverse reactions in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions. Player discretion is advised.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.poster.avif?t=1769255120\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.webm?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/b406a49bb8099bbae774c10030a34652.mp4?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/4b7c63150a8c6f3d24a2671a18c6fa4c.avif?t=1769255120\" width=1560 height=93 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Horror:</strong>\u00a0A deeply story-focused experience, with an atmosphere that surrounds you in tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong>\u00a0Walking simulator emphasizing exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style:</strong> An aesthetic inspired by the early 2000s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Fear:</strong>\u00a0What looks ordinary at first slowly changes into something you can\u2019t explain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design:\u00a0</strong>Immersive audio wraps around you, raising the tension and slowly drawing you into madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle Solving:</strong>\u00a0Solve intricate puzzles to progress and unveil mysteries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.poster.avif?t=1769255120\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.webm?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/extras/a0270f1f71188cef692d4b1ede45df71.mp4?t=1769255120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033710?t=1769255120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/61786b6e3cf0ebe0a17feaf27700f329d46b660a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769255120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/ac8b755e2bad92265272a1d0b77f7682f15b72a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769255120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033710/ac8b755e2bad92265272a1d0b77f7682f15b72a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769255120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence that may negatively affect the viewer\u2019s psychological state. Some content may be inappropriate for certain age groups. It is advised to apply suitable 